# Current Execution Context Example

Copy this file to `.agent/current_execution_context.md` only for local runs.
The live file is ignored and must not be committed.

## Active package

Package 2 - DuckDB warehouse and source contract validation

## Active goal

Load generated synthetic SaaS source CSVs into a local DuckDB analytical
warehouse and validate raw source-table contracts.

Package 2 proves that source CSVs can be safely persisted and validated in
DuckDB; it does not make the data model-ready.

## Current unit

Set this manually for the active Package 2 unit.

## Default source path

`data/generated/`

## Default warehouse path

`data/warehouse/account_health.duckdb`

## Warehouse schemas

- `raw`
- `metadata`

## Raw source tables

- `raw.accounts`
- `raw.users`
- `raw.usage_events`
- `raw.subscriptions`
- `raw.invoices`
- `raw.support_tickets`
- `raw.crm_touchpoints`
- `raw.renewals`

## Optional metadata table

- `metadata.load_audit`

## Package 2 exclusions

Do not add:

- Account-month features
- Churn labels
- Expansion labels
- Feature engineering
- Model training
- MLflow logic
- Champion selection
- Batch scoring
- Health bands
- Recommended GTM actions
- Monitoring reports
- Dashboards
- Notebooks
- APIs
- Cloud deployment
- Vercel
- Real SaaS integrations
- Real customer data
- Incremental loading
- dbt
- Orchestration frameworks

## Security reminders

Do not commit:

- `AGENTS.override.md`
- `.agent/current_execution_context.md`
- `.agent/package_gate.md`
- `.agent/agent_runbook.md`
- `.env`
- `.pytest_cache/`
- `scripts/__pycache__/`
- `tests/__pycache__/`
- `src/**/__pycache__/`
- `mlruns/`
- `*.duckdb`
- `*.duckdb.wal`
- `*.db`
- `data/generated/`
- `data/warehouse/`
- `data/processed/`
- `data/outputs/`
- `artifacts/models/`
- `artifacts/tmp/`
- `*.egg-info/`
